-to-node=\"10,1,1,1,0\">2x Extra reserve propellers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Garantie:</strong> Je krijgt van ons <strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">2 maanden garantie</strong> op de volledige werking van de drone. 🛡️</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
